# Eval run artifacts — reproducible by re-running; the durable findings live in
# evals/RESULTS-2nd.md and the design record under docs/.
evals/out/
evals/*.log

# Probe opt-in markers (hooks/*.mjs, `/yfx on`): local switches, never committed.
.claude/*.on

# Laid by Claude Code beside a mod at every load (this build's API types); regenerated, never edited.
mods/*/.claude-plugin/types/
